main/main.c started from ESP-IDF 5.5's example
examples/bluetooth/hci/controller_hci_uart_esp32c3_and_esp32s3, which
Espressif publishes under "Unlicense OR CC0-1.0"; the changes for the frame
(the silent start, the pins, the reset replay) are ours, under Apache-2.0.

The Bluetooth controller itself is Espressif's closed library, shipped with
ESP-IDF under its own terms; nothing of it is in this repository.
